<Layout title="About Bloc | Bloc Microfinance Bank" description="Bloc Microfinance Bank is licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria. Read our mission, vision and values, and find our licence and company details." path="/about/" section="company" breadcrumb={[{"name": "About Bloc", "path": "/about/"}]} preload="/assets/photo-market-woman.webp">
<section class="iph ph2c"><div class="w"><div class="ihl">
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>About Bloc</span></nav>
<h1>A licensed bank for individuals and businesses.</h1>
<p class="lead">Bloc Microfinance Bank is licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria. People and businesses use Bloc to send money, save, borrow and run their accounts from one app.</p>
<div class="acts"><a class="btn p" href="/personal/#download">Download app</a><a class="btn o" href="/business/#open">Open a business account</a></div>
</div><img class="ipimg" src="/assets/photo-market-woman.webp" alt="A smiling market trader checking her phone at her stall in Lagos" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div></section><section class="sec" id="what"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>What we do</span></div>
<h2>Banking for people and for business.</h2>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Personal banking</h3><p>Send and receive money, pay bills, save toward a goal and take a loan, all in the app.</p><a class="more" href="/personal/">Explore personal <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/><path d="M8 6h.01M12 6h.01M16 6h.01M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M16 14h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Business banking</h3><p>An account in your company name for registered businesses.</p><a class="more" href="/business/">Explore business <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></div><h3>Clear by design</h3><p>Fees shown before you confirm, and a clear confirmation at every step.</p><a class="more" href="/charges/">Charges and rates <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
</div></div></section><section class="stmt" aria-label="Regulation"><div class="w"><div><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Regulation</span></div><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Licensed by the CBN.<br>Insured by the NDIC.</h2>
<p>Bloc Microfinance Bank operates under a licence from the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation, subject to its limits.</p></div>
<div class="sl"><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="141" height="150" src="/assets/reg-cbn.png" alt="CBN logo"></div><div><b>Licensed by the CBN</b><span>Central Bank of Nigeria</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="420" height="178" src="/assets/reg-ndic.png" alt="NDIC logo"></div><div><b>Insured by NDIC</b><span>Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="160" height="160" src="/assets/reg-ndpc.png" alt="NDPC logo"></div><div><b>NDPA compliant</b><span>Nigeria Data Protection Act</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec sky" id="story"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Mission and vision</span></div>
<h2>Why Bloc exists.</h2></div>
<div class="ipl"><div class="ipn"><b>Our mission</b><span>To empower businesses and individuals with innovative, accessible and secure financial solutions. We bridge the gap between traditional banking and modern technology, with tools that help customers grow, save and transact with confidence.</span></div>
<div class="ipn"><b>Our vision</b><span>To be Nigeria's most trusted microfinance bank, known for exceptional service, financial inclusion and solutions that help communities thrive.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="values"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Our values</span></div>
<h2>What guides us.</h2>
<div class="grid4b">
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Customer first</h3><p>Every decision starts with our customers. We build products that solve real financial problems for businesses and individuals.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Trust and integrity</h3><p>We work to high standards of transparency and ethical conduct, to keep the trust customers give us.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div><h3>Innovation</h3><p>We use technology to deliver modern banking that is accessible, efficient and built for the future of finance in Nigeria.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.45 5.11L2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"/></svg></div><h3>Inclusion</h3><p>Everyone deserves access to quality financial services. Our tiered accounts and digital platforms make banking open to all.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="sec" id="details"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Company details</span></div>
